  {
    "featureId": "gm:grenade",
    "id": "gm:grenade/blast",
    "text": "Friendly fire: the blast hurts everything alive within {{gm:grenade/damage-range}} blocks, not only hostile mobs. That includes you, other players, pets and villagers. Damage is highest at the centre, up to 43 (more than a full health bar), and less with distance and behind cover, so throw it well away from yourself and your friends. It works underwater and does not break blocks, start fires or destroy items lying on the ground.",
